OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #130m county hall revamp
OL,4,Aset for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to convert Derbyshire County
OL,7,FCouncil's headquarters into a hotel and
OL,8,Fnew homes are set to get the go-ahead.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Dales District Council's
OL,11,Fplanning committee has been recommended
OL,12,Fto approve plans from Derbyshire County
OL,13,FCouncil to revamp County Hall in
OL,14,FMatlock - otherwise known as Smedley's
OL,15,FHydro - when it meets on Tuesday.
OL,17,FAccording to the county council, the
OL,18,Fproposed #130m redevelopment would also
OL,19,Finclude the restoration of the Winter
OL,20,FGardens.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
